# Line endings are fixed here instead of being left to each machine's git settings. Shell scripts, gradlew and the
# Dockerfiles run inside Linux containers, where the CRLF endings of a default Windows checkout break them
# ("/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter"). Windows command files keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.jar binary
